  "contentHtml": "<p>독서는 책의 저자와 독자의 대화입니다.</p><p>대화를 통해</p><p>공감하고, 깊이있게 생각하고, 깊이있는 질문을 떠올리게 되어 좋습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>독서토론을 하는 이유는</p><p>상대방의 생각에 공감하고, 반론하고,</p><p>내가 미처 생각하지 못하는 부분을 깨닫게 되고, 자기 생각을 만들 수 있기 때문입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#39;엔트로피&#39;를 읽기 시작합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cb7b37a2a058f12266ff29e1419ad87066ab979e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cb7b37a2a058f12266ff29e1419ad87066ab979e\" data-origin-width=\"336\" data-origin-height=\"389\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>이번에는&#160;</p><p>챗GPT와 대화를 나누면서 읽어봅니다.</p><p>특히 이해가 잘 안되는 문장이나 궁금한 점을 중심으로</p><p>대화를 나눕니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/50c8e145ae4099ac1badf940e34ef4d256cf0121\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/50c8e145ae4099ac1badf940e34ef4d256cf0121\" data-origin-width=\"364\" data-origin-height=\"67\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/454f47193c1344e2b9bd55715d22373c485e0b24\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"149\" height=\"54\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/454f47193c1344e2b9bd55715d22373c485e0b24\" data-origin-width=\"160\" data-origin-height=\"58\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/edca72da028933df2c69b69683ef1370ee6d5e80\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"501\" height=\"185\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/edca72da028933df2c69b69683ef1370ee6d5e80\" data-origin-width=\"696\" data-origin-height=\"257\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1159550288012be592cc83adad4cde0068ca097c\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"459\" height=\"77\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1159550288012be592cc83adad4cde0068ca097c\" data-origin-width=\"566\" data-origin-height=\"95\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/475a2a8b4caf3ed12057d660ce30df12c8199b65\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"460\" height=\"236\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/475a2a8b4caf3ed12057d660ce30df12c8199b65\" data-origin-width=\"592\" data-origin-height=\"304\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dd0618341f507c995bcff9bf53c9d12d51a18bd0\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"355\" height=\"321\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dd0618341f507c995bcff9bf53c9d12d51a18bd0\" data-origin-width=\"470\" data-origin-height=\"425\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54d9fb1ce07afd6be69e0b30172032e8c1ecbd9e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54d9fb1ce07afd6be69e0b30172032e8c1ecbd9e\" data-origin-width=\"549\" data-origin-height=\"85\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/af8c4c8cf714b87b1319320dbc2c028c0150a0b5\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"568\" height=\"466\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/af8c4c8cf714b87b1319320dbc2c028c0150a0b5\" data-origin-width=\"710\" data-origin-height=\"583\"></div><p><br><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>결론 :</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>AI와 대화를 하면서&#160;</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>구체적인 예시와 비유를 통해</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>개념이 명쾌해지고, 저의 사고가 확장되는 것을 알 수 있습니다.</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>&#39;엔트로피&#39;를 계속 읽으면서</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>계속 대화를 나눠 보겠습니다~</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>&#160;</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
